i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M8ttp1g6OnoQ7kNvwGtAj6l&_nc_oc=AdrKwNMEg1sdVDav7NeGUWW8ZyxePACxE0VKpj5pt0xYoFsRwRsQYaj5QmNP5TxGeEA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQC-qXUIDLOQhSiVTNphINiwhVhGPZqqt1ZEHAwTz97iA&oe=6AEF5B63"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8q7pTlCMpToQ7kNvwGuI83y&_nc_oc=AdrlFn6tXBLWZgT3XlguITEYcuugoPWBuza3nVSE-9W9MPaM2p5E-fK2YozEQ4CjLzg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR_Qf2gfKJnojX8KiQ5IFvKyNQicji9S8upnYjuP3kIAQ&oe=6AEF475D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=drcbhVvJC0sQ7kNvwEwL7z2&_nc_oc=AdqkzmJNYk2C-rh5Sh6DXtiR1kNULQJunVJPryYj9DZGE21_ZUCg5cBlfad97hgKH-U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTA3_PmTD2Ee-QKro-gs-C3wv-N4toRa-Byv9lzYeze0g&oe=6AEF35CA"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im